# Deployment

## Docker images

- app/Dockerfile builds Nuxt output (.output) and runs node .output/server/index.mjs
- microservice/Dockerfile builds Nitro-based service; also exposes a runner-keyrotate target with kubectl/jq for in-cluster key rotation CronJob

## CI/CD (GitHub Actions)

- .github/workflows/pr.yml (PR checks)
  - Lint (pnpm lint), Tests (Vitest), pre-commit security (trufflehog + pre-commit), CodeQL
  - Build & push images to gcr.io (app and microservice) for the PR
  - Deploy to GKE staging (manifests rendered via .github/actions/deploy-dineros-gke)
  - Verify rollout and GET https://staging.dineros.cc/health/ready
- .github/workflows/main.yml (push to main/master)
  - Build & push images to gcr.io with sha + latest tags
  - Deploy to production GKE, then verify rollout and health
- .github/workflows/e2e-update-staging-snapshots.yml (manual) — regenerate Playwright visual baselines against staging
- .github/workflows/codeql.yml — scheduled CodeQL scan
- .github/workflows/sonar.yml — optional SonarQube scan (manual)

Authentication to GCP uses Workload Identity (google-github-actions/auth). Images are pushed with docker/build-push-action. Deploys rendered with envsubst then kubectl apply (see .github/scripts/deploy-dineros-gke.sh).

## Kubernetes manifests

- .deploy/dineros.template.yaml — Namespace, Deployments (app and microservice), Services, Ingress
  - DB secrets split: DATABASE_URL from SECRET_DATABASE_MAIN/SECRET_DATABASE_MICRO; encryption keys from SECRET_DB
  - Env: REDIS_HOST/PORT, INTERNAL_API_TOKEN, PLAID, POSTMARK, OPENAI, JWT_SECRET
  - Health probes hit /health/ready and /health/live routes
- .deploy/key-rotation-cronjob.template.yaml — staging-only nightly DB key rotation; uses the microservice runner-keyrotate image
- .deploy/key-rotation-rbac.template.yaml — Role/RoleBinding to allow the CronJob to patch secrets and roll deployments

## Local development

- docker-compose.yaml provides MySQL 8.0.43 and Redis 8.x locally (bound to 127.0.0.1)
- .devcontainer/docker-compose.yml offers a devcontainer with MySQL/Redis sidecars
- Typical flow:
  - cp .env.example .env
  - docker compose up -d
  - pnpm install
  - pnpm --filter dineros-app exec prisma migrate deploy
  - pnpm dev

## Environment variables

- Required for server startup validated in app/server/env.ts + envSchema.ts
- CI examples for tests: see pr.yml and sonar.yml (DATABASE_URL dummy, DB_ENCRYPTION_KEY minimal, PLAID_* placeholders)
